        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CFRBAF Frosted Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The frosted acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.  These are great pulls for glass shower doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions CFRBAF Frosted Acrylic Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Standard Lengths</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBAF/9: Total Length 9\" - Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBAF/12: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBAF/18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBAF/24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The First Impressions frosted acrylic door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Pair of <a href=\"/products/frosted-acrylic-door-pulls-pair-first-impressions-pr-cfrbaf\"><b>Back to Back Frosted Acrylic Door Handles</b></a> for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Frosted Acrylic Door Pull, First Impressions CFRBAF",
                "description": "First Impressions CFRBAF Frosted Acrylic Door Pull available in 4 lengths of 9 inches, 12 inches, 18 inches or 24 inches. Perfect for glass shower doors.",
